WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.125
To sum up.

2
00:00:01.125 --> 00:00:06.862
The program's AWS GovCloud and O C I workload
identities follow the track's rules.

3
00:00:06.862 --> 00:00:11.612
Every one is listed from read-only exports
and joined to a record by four tags.

4
00:00:11.612 --> 00:00:14.613
Its long-lived credentials
are exceptions with a date.

5
00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:16.901
Its trusts are named down to the workload.

6
00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:20.163
And its unknowns stay unknowns
until the program tests them.

7
00:00:20.163 --> 00:00:24.626
Chapter 13 checks the exports on
every run, V K N P I ten reports the

8
00:00:24.626 --> 00:00:29.425
gate's criteria, and the evidence
names the control each row supports.

9
00:00:29.425 --> 00:00:32.464
Next, go back to the
learning path's index,

10
00:00:32.464 --> 00:00:35.690
or on to Chapter 13 for
Lab 2 and its dangers.
